sielky"],"Allow customers to add shipping protection to their order.":["Umo\u017enite z\u00e1kazn\u00edkom prida\u0165 ochranu z\u00e1sielky k objedn\u00e1vke."],"Description":["Popis"],"Protect your order from damage or loss":["Chr\u00e1\u0148te svoju objedn\u00e1vku pred po\u0161koden\u00edm alebo stratou"],"Price":["Cena"],"Show Icon":["Zobrazi\u0165 ikonu"],"Display an icon next to the add-on in the cart drawer.":["Zobrazi\u0165 ikonu ved\u013ea doplnku vo vys\u00favacom ko\u0161\u00edku."],"Default State":["Predvolen\u00fd stav"],"Whether the add-on is toggled on or off by default for new visitors.":["\u010ci je doplnok predvolene zapnut\u00fd alebo vypnut\u00fd pre nov\u00fdch n\u00e1v\u0161tevn\u00edkov."],"Off (customer opts in)":["Vypnut\u00e9 (z\u00e1kazn\u00edk sa prihl\u00e1si)"],"On (customer opts out)":["Zapnut\u00e9 (z\u00e1kazn\u00edk sa odhl\u00e1si)"],"WooCommerce minimum":["Minimum WooCommerce"],"Free shipping comes from WooCommerce, not from this meter. Add a Free shipping method with a minimum order amount to your shipping zones in WooCommerce \u2192 Settings \u2192 Shipping. The meter only shows when the shopper\u2019s zone has one.":["Bezplatn\u00e1 doprava poch\u00e1dza z WooCommerce, nie z tohto mera\u010da. Pridajte met\u00f3du Bezplatn\u00e1 doprava s minim\u00e1lnou sumou objedn\u00e1vky do svojich z\u00f3n dopravy v WooCommerce \u2192 Nastavenia \u2192 Doprava. Mera\u010d sa zobrazuje iba vtedy, ke\u010f m\u00e1 z\u00f3na nakupuj\u00faceho jednu."],"Higher free shipping goal (optional)":["Vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed cie\u013e bezplatnej dopravy (volite\u013ene)"],"Leave at 0 to use the minimum order amount from WooCommerce. A higher amount only raises the goal shown in the meter. It does not give free shipping by itself, and amounts below the WooCommerce minimum are ignored.":["Ponechajte na 0, aby sa pou\u017eila minim\u00e1lna suma objedn\u00e1vky z WooCommerce. Vy\u0161\u0161ia suma iba zv\u00fd\u0161i cie\u013e zobrazen\u00fd v mera\u010di. Sama o sebe ned\u00e1va bezplatn\u00fa dopravu a sumy ni\u017e\u0161ie ako minimum WooCommerce s\u00fa ignorovan\u00e9."]}}}